ont-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Tender out – N. Vos, J. Hale ashore</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">T.B.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #A4161A\">20:15</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #A4161A\">Skipper in engine room – generator check</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #A4161A\">T.B.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #A4161A\">20:40</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #A4161A\">Generator OK – skipper back on bridge</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #A4161A\">T.B.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">20:42</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Tender back – N. Vos</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">T.B.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">20:50</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">Owner found in cabin – alarm raised</td><td style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">T.B.</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; line-height: 1.45\">Footnote in the logbook: entries 20:15 and 20:40 added afterwards · last edit T. Becker, 21:52.</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}, {"name": "Tom Becker", "role": "Skipper", "quote": "I was down in the engine room from quarter past eight to twenty to nine – it's all in the log. With the generator running you can't hear a thing down there. Richard was a great boss.", "label": "RICHARD'S TABLET", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%\">\n<div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.3\">Richard's tablet</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; line-height: 1.5\">Found on the desk in his cabin. Sent messages, Saturday.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #ECE8E1; border: 6px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 22px; padding: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; align-items: flex-end\"><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #5C554D\">To: <b style=\"color: #1E1B18\">Claire</b> · 18:40</div><div style=\"max-width: 82%; background: #2F6FD6; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 14px 14px 4px 14px; padding: 9px 13px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4\">Champagne is on ice. See you on the sundeck.</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; align-items: flex-end\"><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #5C554D\">To: <b style=\"color: #1E1B18\">Tom (skipper)</b> · 19:30</div><div style=\"max-width: 82%; background: #2F6FD6; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 14px 14px 4px 14px; padding: 9px 13px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4\">I've seen the booking site. 11 charters this summer I never knew about – €60,000. My cabin, 20:15. We settle this before we're back in port.</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; align-items: flex-end\"><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #5C554D\">To: <b style=\"color: #1E1B18\">Julian</b> · 19:45</div><div style=\"max-width: 82%; background: #2F6FD6; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 14px 14px 4px 14px; padding: 9px 13px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4\">We'll talk about the will when you're sober.</div></div></div>\n</div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-dir