king. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "For two weeks, someone in a long grey raincoat and a rubber gorilla mask has jumped out of the bushes in Willow Park, scaring joggers. No one is hurt – but the whole town is talking. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-14", "suspects": [{"name": "Carla Diaz", "role": "Bootcamp instructor"}, {"name": "Fiona Webb", "role": "Dog walker and bootcamp regular"}, {"name": "Hugo Lambert", "role": "Park keeper"}, {"name": "Neville Barnes", "role": "Neighbour on Elm Row"}, {"name": "Ray Doyle", "role": "Costume shop owner"}, {"name": "Tessa Kim", "role": "Jogger"}], "clues": [{"name": "Tessa Kim", "role": "Jogger", "quote": "He leapt out right in front of me, roared, and ran off towards the houses on Elm Row. I nearly dropped my water bottle. That's the third time this month!", "label": "POLICE NOTE", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Police note – ‘The Phantom’</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Days</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Mondays, Wednesdays and Fridays</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Time</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Always about 19: