ns-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Costume shop owner</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”Someone hired my ‘Monster Detective’ set two weeks ago – grey raincoat and gorilla mask – and never brought it back. I'm in the shop till eight on late-opening days.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · RAY DOYLE</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #4 · HIRE RECORD</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Doyle's Costumes · Hire book</div><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%\"><tr><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 7px 8px; background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4\">Date</th><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; padding: 7px 8px; background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4\">Item</th><th style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; pad