=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Alice Trevor", "motive": "Alice runs a market stall selling watches and jewellery – 120 fake designer watches would sell well there (clue 2).", "proof": ["High water was at 01:40, so a boat could only land in the cove between 23:40 and 03:40 (clue 3).", "Alice's boat was out from 23:30 to 02:10 (clue 6), and the lighthouse saw her lights head east towards the cove at 01:15 (clue 5).", "The paint on the rocks is blue, and the Sea Wren is the only blue boat (clues 1 and 2).", "So her claim that her lights never left the point is a lie (clues 2 and 5)."], "cleared": ["<b>Joe</b> only went out at 03:50, after the cove had closed – and his boat is red (clues 2, 3 and 6). His pots were stolen.", "<b>Dan</b> was back by 23:05 and in the pub until 00:58 (clues 4 and 6).", "<b>Gary, Beth and Ruth</b> have no boat on the harbour log (clue 6)."]}}, {"slug": "fire-at-hollow-mill", "level": 3, "crime": "Arson", "who": "fire-starter", "title": "Fire at Hollow Mill", "teaser": "A historic mill burns down at night. The owner raised his insurance and his lighter is at the scene. Too easy?", "intro": "At two in the morning, Hollow Mill – a protected old watermill used as artists' studios – went up in flames. Nobody was hurt, but the building is gone. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At two in the morning, Hollow Mill – a protected old watermill used as artists' studios – went up in flames. Nobody was hurt, but the building is gone. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-14", "suspects": [{"name": "Hannah Ruiz", "role": "Fire investigator"}, {"name": "Lydia Marsh", "role": "Architect"}, {"name": "Ollie Grant", "role": "Neighbouring farmer"}, {"name": "Rosa Fenn", "role": "Artist who rented a studio"}, {"name": "Simon Ashby", "role": "Property developer"}, {"name": "Victor Crane", "role": "Owner of the mill"}], "clues": [{"name": "Hannah Ruiz", "role": "Fire investigator", "quote": "This fire was set on purpose. Someone poured petrol in the ground-floor store and lit it. Whoever it was left two things behind.", "label": "FIRE REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Fire service report – Hollow Mill</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Date</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Night of 14–15 November</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Started</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">About 02:10, ground-floor store</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Cause</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\"