 still fine (clue 6).", "Nell and Maggie had both left by 23:10, and the theatre stayed open until Ivan left at 00:40 (clue 6).", "June doesn't get the theatre's paper; she delivers it."]}}, {"slug": "the-great-pumpkin-smash", "level": 1, "crime": "Vandalism", "who": "vandal", "title": "The Great Pumpkin Smash", "teaser": "The night before the Giant Vegetable Show, the favourite 312 kg pumpkin is smashed to pieces. Who wanted it out of the contest?", "intro": "At Little Brook Allotments, the night before the Giant Vegetable Show, someone smashed <b>Bert Mills</b>'s giant pumpkin – the favourite to win. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At Little Brook Allotments, the night before the Giant Vegetable Show, someone smashed Bert Mills's giant pumpkin – the favourite to win. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-14", "suspects": [{"name": "Bert Mills", "role": "Owner of the giant pumpkin"}, {"name": "Colin Fenwick", "role": "Farm shop owner"}, {"name": "Doreen Platt", "role": "Rival grower, Plot 4"}, {"name": "Rita Moss", "role": "Bingo caller"}, {"name": "Sunil Rao", "role": "Plot 8, Bert's neighbour"}, {"name": "Wayne Platt", "role": "Doreen's son"}], "clues": [{"name": "Bert Mills", "role": "Owner of the giant pumpkin", "quote": "I checked on her at twenty to nine and she was perfect – 312 kilos! This morning she was in pieces. The show is on Saturday. Somebody wanted me out of it.", "label": "SCENE REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Police report – Plot 1, Little Brook Allotments</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: