; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">At the Fernwood Mushroom Festival, food critic <b>Basil Thorne</b> was judging the stew contest when one spoonful made him ill. He is recovering – but someone did it on purpose. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:the-bitter-spoon/owen-tate}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Owen Tate</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Stall 2 – chanterelle stew</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizi