-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Owen Tate", "motive": "Basil's review closed Owen's restaurant last year (clue 6).", "proof": ["The order was changed because of the rain: stall 4 first, then 3, 2 and 1, at the printed times (clue 3). So 14:00 = stall 4, 14:10 = stall 3, <b>14:20 = stall 2</b>.", "The bitter spoonful came at 14:20 (clues 1 and 6) – Owen's stew. Cooks hand their own bowls to the judge (clue 1).", "That morning Owen's basket held 3 yellow stainers, and he was told to throw them away (clue 5).", "So his claim that Basil tasted his stew at 14:10 and loved it is a lie (clues 3 and 5)."], "cleared": ["<b>Martha</b> looks guilty on the printed programme, but her soup was tasted at 14:10 and scored 9/10 – just as she says (clues 3 and 6).", "<b>Pip</b>'s pie was tasted at 14:00 (clues 4 and 6), and <b>Hilda</b>'s broth was never tasted (clue 6).", "<b>Lucy</b> never touches the bowls (clue 1), and <b>Bart</b> was on the main stage (clue 4)."]}}, {"slug": "the-stolen-scent", "level": 2, "crime": "Espionage", "who": "spy", "title": "The Stolen Scent", "teaser": "A perfume house's secret formula is photographed from the safe on the night the clocks go back. One suspect's alibi is an hour too late.", "intro": "At the perfume house Maison Lune, someone opened the lab safe and photographed the secret formula for the new scent <b>Nuit Bleue</b>. A week later, a rival launched it. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At the perfume house Maison Lune, someone opened the lab safe and photographed the secret formula for the new scent Nuit Bleue. A week later, a rival launched it. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-14", "suspects": [{"name": "Ana Vidal", "role": "Cleaner"}, {"name": "Bruno Kask", "role": "Night guard"}, {"name": "Céline Ardent", "role": "Head perfumer"}, {"name": "Hugo Fabre", "role": "Sales director"}, {"name": "Ravi Joshi", "role": "Chemist"}, {"name": "Theo Blanc", "role": "Apprentice perfumer"}], "clues": [{"name": "Céline Ardent", "role": "Head perfumer", "quote": "Only three of us know the code: me, Hugo and Ravi. At half past four I was in a taxi to the airport – yes, it drives right past our door, but I never stopped.", "label": "SECURITY REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Security report – Maison Lune perfume lab</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Safe</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Opened with the right code</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Safe's own log</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Opened <b>04:35</b>, closed 04:52</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Formula</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Pages photographed and put back in the wrong order</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">A week later</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Rival house Orage launched the same scent</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">That night</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Sunday 25 October – clocks went back one hour at 03:00</div></div></div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 72 · LEVEL 2 · ESPIONAGE</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE STOLEN<br>SCENT</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">1</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; ali