 flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}, {"name": "Rafael Mendes", "role": "Runner, fourth veteran", "quote": "Fourth – no prize for me. My sister took photos along the course. Have a look at the last one.", "label": "SPECTATOR PHOTOS", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Photos by Rafael's sister</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:the-marathon-shortcut/img-201|IMG_201}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">10:12</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">Rafael (blue vest) on the river path by the 14 km sign.</div>\n</div><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:the-marathon-shortcut/img-204|IMG_204}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime