yle=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">6</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\"><b>Ludovic Brenner</b>, owner of the Summit Restaurant, was found dead in his office at the top of the mountain. Tonight the cable car is the only way up or down. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:death-at-the-summit-station/henning-lie}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Henning Lie</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Barman in the valley</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”The bar is two minutes' walk from the bottom station. Inga came in with her guest just after nine. Anselm turned up much later, looking pale.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · HENNING LIE</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #6 · BAR TAB</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; height: 100%\">\n<div style=\"width: 340px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 16px 20px; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.55; transform: rotate(-1.5deg)\"><div style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px\">THE VALLEY BAR</div><div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px\">Friday</div><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed #1E1B18; margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 6px\"></div><div>21:12  I. Dahlberg – 2 hot chocolates</div><div>21:42  A. Voight – brandy</div><div style=\"border-top: 1px dashed #1E1B18; margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 6px\"></div><div style=\"font-weight: 700\">Barman: H. Lie, on shift 18:00–23:00</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Anselm Voight", "motive": "Ludovic was ending their partnership – they were shouting about it that afternoon (clue 3).", "proof": ["Because of the wind, cars only ran on the hour and half hour (clue 2). There was <b>no 21:15 car</b>, whatever the printed timetable says (clue 4).", "After 21:00, the only car down was at 21:30 – with one passenger (clue 5). Anselm reached the bar at 21:42 (clue 6): 21:30 + 8 minutes' ride + 2 minutes' walk.", "So Anselm was still at the summit during the time of death, 21:05–21:25 (clue 1).", "His claim that he took the 21:15 car is a lie (clues 2 and 4)."], "cleared": ["<b>Inga</b> took the 21:00 car down with her guest and was in the bar at 21:12 (clues 5 and 6).", "<b>Margit</b> cooked and <b>Solveig</b> carried every dish from 21:02 to 21:26 (clue 3).", "<b>Torvald</b> was on camera at the controls all evening (clue 2), and <b>Henning</b> was behind the bar in the valley (clue 6)."]}}, {"slug": "the-borrowed-name", "level": 2, "crime": "Identity Theft", "who": "identity thief", "title": "The Borrowed Name", "teaser": "Someone opened an account in a retired teacher's name and bought a £1,200 telescope. The lodger has a perfect alibi – or has she?", "intro": "Retired teacher <b>Philippa Greaves</b> got a bill for a £1,200 telescope she never ordered. Someone used her name and date of birth. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "Retired teacher Philippa Greaves got a bill for a £1,200 telescope she never ordered. Someone used her name and date of birth. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": "2026-11-23", "public": "2026-11-23", 