olid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Damaris Oyelaran", "motive": "Damaris lives in the room where Philippa's old files are kept, so she had her name, date of birth and old address (clue 4).", "proof": ["The shop and the locker are American and write dates month first. ‘05/06/2026’ can't be 5 June – the bill came on 12 May (clue 1). It is <b>6 May</b>, which the courier's app confirms (clues 2 and 6).", "So the account was opened on <b>4 May</b>, not 5 April (clue 3). Damaris's Lisbon trip in April proves nothing (clue 4).", "On 6 May a woman in a green raincoat and helmet collected the parcel at 18:40 (clue 2). Damaris cycled off in exactly that at 18:25 and came back with a long box at 18:58 (clue 5).", "So her claims that she was abroad and never cycles are lies (clue 4)."], "cleared": ["The locker camera shows a woman, which rules out <b>Crispin, Yusuf and Clive</b> (clue 2).", "<b>Tamsin</b>'s van was 40 miles away from 16:45 (clue 6), and <b>Philippa</b> is the victim – she came home from bridge at 19:10 (clue 5)."]}}, {"slug": "the-syndicate-ticket", "level": 3, "crime": "Fraud", "who": "fraudster", "title": "The Syndicate Ticket", "teaser": "The bus depot's lottery numbers finally come up – £90,000! But the organiser says she forgot to buy the ticket. Then a stranger claims the prize.", "intro": "For six years the drivers at Northgate Bus Depot have played the same lottery numbers every week. On Saturday they came up. On Monday, a stranger claimed the £90,000. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "For six years the drivers at Northgate Bus Depot have played the same lottery numbers every week. On Saturday they came up. On Monday, a stranger claimed the £90,000. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": "2026-11-25", "public": "2026-11-25", "suspects": [{"name": "Bernadette Quayle", "role": "Driver, social club treasurer"}, {"name": "Clifford Hume", "role": "Driver, syndicate member"}, {"name": "Dorian Pask", "role": "Claimed the prize"}, {"name": "Lalita Sen", "role": "Newsagent"}, {"name": "Maxine Ofori", "role": "Syndicate organiser"}, {"name": "Wes Barlow", "role": "Driver, syndicate member"}], "clues": [{"name": "Wes Barlow", "role": "Driver, syndicate member", "quote": "Six years we've played those numbers, two quid a week each. And the one week they come up, Maxine says she forgot to buy the ticket. Forgot!", "label": "SYNDICATE RULES", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Northgate Depot Lottery Syndicate</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Numbers</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">4 – 11 – 19 – 23 – 30 – 42, every week</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Organiser</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Maxine Ofori buys the ticket every Friday</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Stake</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">£2 a week per member, six members</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Saturday's win</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">£90,000</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-f