rgot’ message is false (clue 1).", "The prize was claimed by Dorian Pask with that same ticket (clues 1 and 5).", "Dorian got the ticket from his fiancée on Saturday morning (clue 5) – and the paper announced the engagement of Maxine Ofori and Dorian Pask (clue 2).", "So ‘never heard of this Pask person’ (clue 2) is a lie, and she gave the ticket away before posting ‘I forgot’ at 21:10 (clues 1 and 5)."], "cleared": ["Clifford lied that he had paid, to get a share (clue 3) – but he never had the card or the ticket.", "Bernadette (money troubles) handles the club's money but not the lottery card – only Maxine holds it (clue 6).", "Dorian was given the ticket as a ‘wedding treat’ (clue 5).", "Wes and Lalita never had the card or the ticket (clues 4 and 6)."]}}, {"slug": "the-giant-marrow-mystery", "level": 1, "crime": "Sabotage", "who": "saboteur", "title": "The Giant Marrow Mystery", "teaser": "The night before the allotment show, the biggest marrow in Netherby is slashed. A scrap of orange waterproof hangs on the tent pole.", "intro": "At the Netherby Allotment Show, someone slashed <b>Big Bertha</b>, the favourite giant marrow, during the night before the judging. A damaged marrow is disqualified. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At the Netherby Allotment Show, someone slashed Big Bertha, the favourite giant marrow, during the night before the judging. A damaged marrow is disqualified. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": "2026-11-26", "public": "2026-11-26", "suspects": [{"name": "Agnes Bell", "role": "Grower, quiz team"}, {"name": "Cyril Ashdown", "role": "Rival grower"}, {"name": "Mabel Thornbury", "role": "Grower of Big Bertha"}, {"name": "Ned Huxley", "role": "Show steward"}, {"name": "Priya Sandhu", "role": "Quizmaster"}, {"name": "Wendell Price", "role": "Outdoor shop owner"}], "clues": [{"name": "Mabel Thornbury", "role": "Grower of Big Bertha", "quote": "Three months of feeding and watering, and now look at her. She was perfect when they tied up the tent. Somebody came back in the night with a knife.", "label": "STEWARD'S REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Show steward's report</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Weighed</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">20:30 – Big Bertha, 51 kg</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Show tent tied shut</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">21:00</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Found slashed</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">06:45 – by Mabel</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">On the tent pole</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">A torn scrap of <b>orange waterproof</b></d