; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Cyril Ashdown", "motive": "With Big Bertha disqualified, Cyril's marrow becomes the biggest and wins the cup and £200 (clue 3).", "proof": ["Cyril left the quiz at 21:30, not at closing time (clue 2).", "At 21:45 someone in an orange waterproof went in through the gate and left at 21:58 (clue 4). Nobody else came in all night.", "Cyril wore an orange waterproof to the quiz, and both he and it were gone by 22:30 (clue 5). A scrap of orange waterproof was on the tent pole (clue 1).", "The next morning he bought a new one because his old one had ripped on a pole (clue 6). So his story is a lie."], "cleared": ["<b>Agnes and Ned</b> stayed at the quiz until 23:00 (clues 2 and 5), and Ned left the allotments at 21:02 (clue 4).", "<b>Priya</b> ran the quiz all evening (clue 5). <b>Wendell</b> was at his till until 21:57 (clue 6), and the only visitor to the allotments that night wore Cyril's orange waterproof (clues 4 and 5).", "<b>Mabel</b> grew Big Bertha and only came in at 06:40 (clue 4)."]}}, {"slug": "the-hijacked-scoreboard", "level": 2, "crime": "Hacking", "who": "hacker", "title": "The Hijacked Scoreboard", "teaser": "In the ice hockey cup final shootout, the giant scoreboard starts clucking like a hen. The operator was alone in the booth – but was he at the controls?", "intro": "During the penalty shootout of the Fenwick Ice Cup final, the arena scoreboard was hacked. The home team, the Falcons, lost the Cup. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "During the penalty shootout of the Fenwick Ice Cup final, the arena scoreboard was hacked. The home team, the Falcons, lost the Cup. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-14", "daily": "2026-11-27", "public": "2026-11-27", "suspects": [{"name": "Brenda Hale", "role": "Coach, Fenwick Falcons"}, {"name": "Desmond Oduya", "role": "Coach, Rovers"}, {"name": "Marco Kellerman", "role": "Press officer, Rovers"}, {"name": "Mia Kowalski", "role": "Falcons social media"}, {"name": "Nell Ashworth", "role": "Arena IT technician"}, {"name": "Theo Grant", "role": "Scoreboard operator"}], "clues": [{"name": "Brenda Hale", "role": "Coach, Fenwick Falcons", "quote": "Our goalie was about to face the last penalty when the board went crazy. He couldn't think for the noise. Someone did that on purpose.", "label": "INCIDENT REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Arena incident report</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">21:30</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Shootout, last penalty. The scoreboard flashes ‘FALCONS = CHICKENS!’ with loud clucking</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">21:33</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Board back to normal. The Rovers score – and win the Cup 3–2</div></div><div styl