x; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}, {"name": "Clive Marchetti", "role": "Club treasurer", "quote": "I never left the meeting room until Harriet locked up, and I haven't set foot in the boat store office for weeks. The club's money is in perfect order, I can assure you.", "label": "AUDITOR'S LETTER", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 18px 22px; transform: rotate(-1deg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 23px, #E3DCCF 24px)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #5C554D\">LETTER – FROM THE CLUB'S AUDITOR</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Dear Mr Marchetti, the audit is on Monday at 9:00.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Please bring ALL account books from the boat store office.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">The bank shows £8,000 paid from the club into an</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">account in your own name. Please explain.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; color: #A4161A; text-align: right\">– Hardy &amp; Co., auditors</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 94 · LEVEL 3 · ARSON</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE BOATHOUSE<br>BLAZE</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">4</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">In the night after a committee meeting, fire swept through the <b>Kingsmere Rowing Club</b> boathouse. The old racing boat Swan and all the club's account books were destroyed. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:the-boathouse-blaze/clive-marchetti}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Clive Marchetti</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Club treasurer</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”I never left the meeting room until Harriet locked up, and I haven't set foot in the boat store office for weeks. The club's money is in perfect order, I can assure you.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · CLIVE MARCHETTI</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #4 · AUDITOR'S LETTER</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 18px 22px; transform: rotate(-1deg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 23px, #E3DCCF 24px)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #5C554D\">LETTER – FROM THE CLUB'S AUDITOR</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Dear Mr Marchetti, the audit is on Monday at 9:00.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Please bring ALL account books from the boat store office.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">The bank shows £8,000 paid from the club into an</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">account in your own name. Please explain.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; color: #A4161A; text-align: right\">– Hardy &amp; Co., auditors</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><