; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}, {"name": "Dr Nadia Lund", "role": "Zoo vet", "quote": "I was at a farm calving all night, and nowhere near the zoo. Then an animal officer called me at eleven with some very good news.", "label": "VET'S NOTE", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 18px 22px; transform: rotate(-1deg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 23px, #E3DCCF 24px)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #5C554D\">VET'S NOTE – THURSDAY, 11:05</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Penguin found in a paddling pool</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">behind Sprock's Fish Bar.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Yellow ring, left flipper. Chip read: PEBBLES.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">Healthy, full of herring, very cross.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; color: #A4161A; text-align: right\">– Dr N. Lund</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 89 · LEVEL 1 · DISAPPEARANCE</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE VANISHING<br>PENGUIN</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spaci