he statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:murder-on-the-midnight-ferry/ricky-lane}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Ricky Lane</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Karaoke host</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”I run the karaoke in the Starlight Lounge from midnight till two, and I never leave the mixing desk. The lounge clock is on ship's time like every clock on board.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · RICKY LANE</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #6 · KARAOKE LIST</div>\n<d