adding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C9C0B1; color: #1E1B18\">88 – WINNER</td></tr></table></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}, {"name": "Nell Barker", "role": "Tea bar, backstage", "quote": "Nobody gets to the green rooms without passing my tea bar. Ravensby's singers weren't here yet, but their conductor was – he came early, by car.", "label": "TEA BAR NOTES", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 18px 22px; transform: rotate(-1deg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 23px, #E3DCCF 24px)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #5C554D\">NELL'S TEA BAR NOTES</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">13:30 – Mr Rook (Ravensby) arrives, alone.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">14:10 – Mr Rook buys a big bottle of orange squash</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">‘for the lads’ and walks off to the green rooms.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">14:20 – back past me. No bottle.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; color: #A4161A; text-align: right\">– Nell</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 103 · LEVEL 2 · SABOTAGE</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE CHOIR CONTEST<br>SABOTAGE</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">6</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">At the <b>Harrowdale Choir Festival</b>, someone poured orange squash all over the piano music of the Brightwater Singers, the three-time champions. They had to sing without piano and lost. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:the-choir-contest-sabotage/nell-barker}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Nell Barker</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Tea bar, backstage</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”Nobody gets to the green rooms without passing my tea bar. Ravensby's singers weren't here yet, but their conductor was – he came early, by car.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · NELL BARKER</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #6 · TEA BAR NOTES</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%; align-items: center\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 18px 22px; transform: rotate(-1deg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(transparent, transparent 23px, #E3DCCF 24px)\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #5C554D\">NELL'S TEA BAR NOTES</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">13:30 – Mr Rook (Ravensby) arrives, alone.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">14:10 – Mr Rook buys a big bottle of orange squash</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">‘for the lads’ and walks off to the green rooms.</div><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1E1B18\">14:20 – back past me. No bottle.</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; color: #A4161A; text-align: right\">– Nell</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Desmond Rook", "motive": "Ravensby had come second to Brightwater three years running. With Brightwater's music ruined, Ravensby won (clues 2 and 5).", "proof": ["The trick: the printed programme is out of date. At 11:55 the office swapped Ravensby and Thistle because Ravensby's coach broke down (clue 4).", "So at 14:00–14:30 Desmond was not on stage – Thistle was (clue 5). His alibi is a lie.", "At 14:10 he bought a big bottle of orange squash and walked to the green rooms, then came back at 14:20 without it (clue 6). The music was soaked in orange squash (clue 1)."], "cleared": ["<b>Glenys</b> is the false lead: the old programme makes her look free, but she was conducting on stage at 14:00–14:25 (clue 5).", "<b>Sam</b> was on the broken-down coach until 14:48 (clue 4). <b>Felix</b> sat at the judges' table all afternoon (clue 5).", "<b>Mei Ling</b> was in the chapel with thirty singers (clue 1), and <b>Nell</b> never left her tea bar (clue 6)."]}}, {"slug": "death-at-the-chess-congress", "level": 3, "crime": "Murder", "who": "killer", "title": "Death at the Chess Congress", "teaser": "The tournament director dies in his back room during round 4. A player's scorecard lies by the body, and the door steward swears no one passed her.", "intro": "At the <b>Ravensworth Chess Congress</b>, director <b>Sebastian Crowe</b> was found dead in the arbiter's room behind the playing hall during round 4. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At the Ravensworth Chess Congress, director Sebastian Crowe was found dead in the arbiter's room behind the playing hall during round 4. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-15", "daily": "2026-12-13", "public": "2026-12-13", "suspects": [{"name": "Dolly Fenwick", "role": "Door steward"}, {"name": "Edgar Pellow", "role": "Player, board 2"}, {"name": "Leopold Crowe", "role": "Sebastian's brother"}, {"name": "Rosalind Ash", "