. I was at the Crown quiz until five to ten, then I walked straight home to Mill Lane and was in bed by ten. Our team won, for once. Ask the landlord.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · CLIVE ASHDOWN</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #6 · MARKET SQUARE CAMERA</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Market Square camera – tower door</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:death-in-the-clock-tower/cam-sq|CAM_SQ}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">21:15</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">Horace opens the tower door with the keypad and goes in.</div>\n</div><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:death-in-the-clock-tower/cam-sq-2|CAM_SQ}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">21:33</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">A man in a cap goes in. He comes out at 21:48 and drives off in a blue van.</div>\n</div><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:death-in-the-clock-tower/cam-sq-3|CAM_SQ}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">22:06</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">Someone in a long coat and hat goes in, holding a shiny cup. Out again at 22:19.</div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Clive Ashdown", "motive": "Horace had found out that the old brass wheels of the clock had been swapped for cheap copies, and that a Committee man had signed the bill (clue 5). Clive chairs the Clock Committee (clue 6) and was about to be exposed to the Mayor.", "proof": ["The clock was found with its hands at 9:40 (clue 1), but it struck ten at 22:00 (clue 2). So it was still running at ten: the killer stopped it later and turned the hands back to 9:40, a time when Clive was handing in his quiz answers.", "Horace was still alive and writing at 21:58 (clue 5), after Wilf had gone. So he died after the clock struck ten.", "Only one person entered the tower after 22:00: someone in a long coat and hat, holding a shiny cup, from 22:06 to 22:19 (clue 6).", "Clive left the Crown at 21:55 carrying the silver prize tankard (clue 2). He did not walk ‘straight home’ – he went to the tower."], "cleared": ["<b>Wilf</b> had a motive and was in the tower until 21:48 (clue 6), but Horace was alive at 21:58 (clue 5) and Wilf was buying diesel 18 miles away at 22:12 (clue 3).", "<b>Gideon</b> lied about being at home – he was embarrassed about his tango class – but he danced from 21:00 to 22:30 (clue 4).", "<b>Rosamund</b> was giving her speech from 22:00 to 22:20 and <b>Ned</b> called last orders at 22:10 (clue 2). <b>Prue</b> was at the hospital laundry all night (clue 1)."]}}, {"slug": "the-planetarium-meteorite", "level": 3, "crime": "Theft", "who": "thief", "title": "The Planetarium Meteorite", "teaser": "A £60,000 meteorite is swapped for painted rock during a sold-out show. The key cabinet logged the theft to the minute. Or did it?", "intro": "At the <b>Kelbridge Planetarium</b>, the Kelbridge Stone – an iron meteorite worth £60,000 – was swapped for a painted fake in its foyer case on a summer Saturday evening. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At the Kelbridge Planetarium, the Kelbridge Stone – an iron meteorite worth £60,000 – was swapped for a painted fake in its foyer case on a summer Saturday evening. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-15", "daily": null, "public": "2026-11-15", "suspects": [{"name": "Agnes Holloway", "role": "Curator"}, {"name": "Barney Cole", "role": "Security guard"}, {"name": "Dora Finch", "role": "Volunteer usher"}, {"name": "Ivy Quist", "role": "Show presenter"}, {"name": "Leo Marchetti", "role": "Presenter and shop assistant"}, {"name": "Sam Okoye", "role": "Technician"}], "clues": [{"name": "Agnes Holloway", "role": "Curator", "quote": "I spotted it at twenty to nine – the Stone looked far too shiny. A painted lump of rock! The case wasn't forced, so someone used key 7. I was in my office on a call with the insurers all evening.", "label": "THEFT REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Theft report – Saturday 14 June</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">19:50</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Guard's round photo: the real Stone, with its deep notch, in the case</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">20:40</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Painted fake found in the case. Opened with key 7, no damage</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Key 7</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Kept in the staff key cabinet upstairs, 3 minutes' walk from the foyer. Any staff card opens it</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Cabinet log</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Key 7 out 19:12 · key 7 back 19:19</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Cabinet clock</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Runs on GMT all year – it is never changed for summer time</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">A. Holloway</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Video call with the insurers, 20:05–20:35 (call log)</div></div></div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 108 · LEVEL 3 · THEFT</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE PLANETARIUM<br>METEORITE</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">1</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">At the <b>Kelbridge Planetarium</b>, the Kelbridge Stone – an iron meteorite worth £60,000 – was swapped for a painted fake in its foyer case on a summer Saturday evening. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:the-planetarium-meteorite/agnes-holloway}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Agnes Holloway</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Curator</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”I spotted it at twenty to nine – the Stone looked far too shiny. A painted lump of rock! The case wasn't forced, so someone used key 7. I was in my office on a call with the insurers all evening.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · AGNES HOLLOWAY</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #1 · THEFT REPORT</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Theft report – Saturday 14 June</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">19:50</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Guard's round photo: the real Stone, with its deep notch, in the case</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">20:40</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Painted fake found in the case. Opened with key 7, no damage</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Key 7</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Kept in the staff key cabinet upstairs, 3 minutes' walk from the foyer. Any staff card opens it</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Cabinet log</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Key 7 out 19:12 · key 7 back 19:19</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Cabinet clock</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Runs on GMT all year – it is never changed for summer time</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">A. Holloway</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Video call with the insurers, 20:05–20:35 (call log)</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}, {"name": "Dora Finch", "role": "Volunteer usher", "quote": "I've ushered here for twelve years. A school class came on Saturday, and their teacher posted lovely photos. I never touch the key cabinet – I don't even know where key 7 lives.", "label": "SCHOOL TRIP PHOTOS", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Kelbridge Primary – trip photos</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:the-planetarium-meteorite/class-4-a|CLASS_4_A}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">20:12</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">In the dome. Dora hands out star charts.</div>\n</div><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:the-planetarium-meteorite/class-4-b|CLASS_4_B}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">20:16</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">Still in the dome. Dora points out the Plough.</div>\n</div><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:the-planetarium-meteorite/class-4-c|CLASS_4_C}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">20:19</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">Dora answers questions in the dome.</div>\n</div></div></div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 108 · LEVEL 3 · THEFT</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE PLANETARIUM<br>METEORITE</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">2</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">At the <b>Kelbridge Planetarium</b>, the Kelbridge Stone – an iron meteorite worth £60,000 – was swapped for a painted fake in its foyer case on a summer Saturday evening. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:the-planetarium-meteorite/dora-finch}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Dora Finch</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Volunteer usher</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18\">”I've ushered here for twelve years. A school class came on Saturday, and their teacher posted lovely photos. I never touch the key cabinet – I don't even know where key 7 lives.”</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">WITNESS STATEMENT · DORA FINCH</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"align-self: flex-start; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 6px 12px\">EVIDENCE #2 · SCHOOL TRIP PHOTOS</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-height: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 18px 20px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden\"><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Kelbridge Primary – trip photos</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:the-planetarium-meteorite/class-4-a|CLASS_4_A}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">20:12</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">In the dome. Dora hands out star charts.</div>\n</div><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:the-planetarium-meteorite/class-4-b|CLASS_4_B}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">20:16</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">Still in the dome. Dora points out the Plough.</div>\n</div><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #C9C0B1; padding: 8px 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"height: 120px; background: #CFC6B6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1E1B18\">{{PHOTO:the-planetarium-meteorite/class-4-c|CLASS_4_C}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A4161A\">20:19</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #1E1B18\">Dora answers questions in the dome.</div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; border-top: 2px solid #1E1B18; padding-top: 14px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;