 column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}, {"name": "Desmond Gale", "role": "Pilot of Blue Moth", "quote": "Sunflower beats us every year, I won't pretend I'll miss her. But at half past six I was inflating Blue Moth in slot 3 with my crew – that job takes every pair of hands. It's all in the programme.", "label": "FIESTA PROGRAMME", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 22px; height: 100%\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 22px; color: #1E1B18; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px\">HILLTOP BALLOON FIESTA</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: #5C554D; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px\">SUNDAY · DAWN RACE · INFLATION ORDER</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #B9B0A2\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; width: 64px; color: #1E1B18\">06:00</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1E1B18\">Slot 1 · Dawn Patrol (2 balloons)</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #B9B0A2\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; width: 64px; color: #1E1B18\">06:15</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #1E1B18\">Slot 2 · Silver Gull</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px dotted #B9B0A2\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Courier Prime', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 16px; 