display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Dean Hollis", "motive": "Dean owed money to half the family (clue 4).", "proof": ["The box vanished between 13:30 and 13:58, when a man in a grey suit was leaving by the side door (clue 1). Dean wore a grey suit (clue 3).", "Dean says he arrived on the 14:10 bus (clue 6). But the wedding was on a Sunday (clue 6), and on Sundays the first bus is at 15:40 (clue 2). There was no 14:10 bus – Dean was already at the barn."], "cleared": ["<b>Rob</b> was photographed at the gift table, but only fetching his speech cards; he was on stage from 13:45 (clue 3).", "<b>Pat</b> was cutting the cake in the kitchen until 14:02 (clue 4), and <b>Laszlo</b> was serving at the bar (clue 5).", "<b>Amy</b> was waiting to speak at 13:55 (clue 3), and <b>Mia</b> was taking the photos from the front (clue 1)."]}}, {"slug": "death-at-the-ski-lodge", "level": 3, "crime": "Murder", "who": "killer", "title": "Death at the Ski Lodge", "teaser": "The lodge owner is found dead at the top of the mountain, and the only way up is the chairlift. The lift remembers every pass – but not every face.", "intro": "In the Norwegian resort of <b>Fjellstua</b>, lodge owner Henrik Aas was found dead in the ski-wax room at the top station of the Summit chairlift. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "In the Norwegian resort of Fjellstua, lodge owner Henrik Aas was found dead in the ski-wax room at the top station of the Summit chairlift. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-18", "daily": "2026-12-26", "public": "2026-12-26", "suspects": [{"name": "Anders Fog", "role": "Ski patrol"}, {"name": "Ingrid Moe", "role": "Lodge manager"}, {"name": "Kari Lund", "role": "Top-station lift operator"}, {"name": "Mette Rask", "role": "Guest, photographer"}, {"name": "Ola Dahl", "role": "Owner of a rival lodge"}, {"name": "Sven Berg", "role": "Ski instructor"}], "clues": [{"name": "Anders Fog", "role": "Ski patrol", "quote": "Kari radioed me at ten past three and I went up on the lift. Before that I was at the first-aid hut at the bottom, strapping up an ankle. Henrik was a good man.", "label": "POLICE REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Police report – Summit top station</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Found</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">15:10, wax room at the top station, by A. Fog</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Death</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Between 14:20 and 14:50</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Top station</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Reachable only by the Summit chair – 9 minutes each way</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bott