 Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">1</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">2</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">3</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">4</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #1E1B18; background: transparent; color: #1E1B18; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">5</div><div style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #A4161A; background: #A4161A; color: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">6</div></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1E1B18\">Find all 6 clues, then scan the code to name the culprit.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 250px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #5C554D\">NEXT CLUE IS HIDDEN …</div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1.5px dashed #1E1B18; height: 30px\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"}], "solution": {"killer": "Ingrid Moe", "motive": "Money was missing from the books, and Henrik was going through the accounts himself that weekend (clue 2). Ingrid kept the accounts.", "proof": ["Pass 4471 rode up at 14:12 and came down at 14:46 (clue 6) – covering the time of death, 14:20–14:50 (clue 1). Pass 4471 is the spare that hangs in the café office (clue 4), where Ingrid says she sat all afternoon.", "At 14:24 a woman in a red Fjellstua jacket carried a folder into the wax room (clue 5). Red jackets are worn by lodge staff (clue 6).", "The only other woman on the staff, Kari, was at the top-station controls with a colleague the whole hour (clue 2). That leaves Ingrid – with her accounts folder."], "cleared": ["<b>Sven</b> lied about teaching – he was at the first-aid hut with a sprained ankle from 14:05 to 14:55 (clue 1) – and instructors wear blue.", "<b>Ola</b> hated Henrik, but he was racing at 14:22 and 14:41 (clue 3).", "<b>Anders</b> was treating Sven (clue 1), <b>Kari</b> was at the controls (clue 2) and <b>Mette</b> wears blue (clue 5)."]}}, {"slug": "the-cup-final-tickets", "level": 2, "crime": "Theft", "who": "thief", "title": "The Cup Final Tickets", "teaser": "Forty cup final tickets vanish from the club safe. One steward has a receipt for four of them – from a day that never happened.", "intro": "At <b>Northbridge Rovers FC</b>, forty tickets for the county cup final – block K, seats 101 to 140 – were stolen from the ticket-office safe overnight. Some are already for sale online. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "intro_text": "At Northbridge Rovers FC, forty tickets for the county cup final – block K, seats 101 to 140 – were stolen from the ticket-office safe overnight. Some are already for sale online. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.", "added": "2026-11-18", "daily": "2026-12-28", "public": "2026-12-28", "suspects": [{"name": "Dale Morgan", "role": "Club steward"}, {"name": "Gaz Hill", "role": "Ticket reseller"}, {"name": "Joan Pike", "role": "Ticket-office clerk"}, {"name": "Mo Kaur", "role": "Cleaner"}, {"name": "Priya Sood", "role": "Club secretary"}, {"name": "Steve Lam", "role": "Head of security"}], "clues": [{"name": "Priya Sood", "role": "Club secretary", "quote": "Block K was our reserve for sponsors. I locked it in the safe the day the printer delivered it, and nobody was meant to touch it until the sponsors' draw.", "label": "THEFT REPORT", "evidence": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px\"><div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 19px; color: #1E1B18; margin-bottom: 6px\">Theft report – ticket office</div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Missing</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Cup final tickets, block K, seats 101–140</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Printed</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Delivered by the printer on Friday 3 March 2023</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Kept</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">In the ticket-office safe from 3 March</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Last checked</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Thursday 9 March, 17:00 – all there</div></div><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D8D0C2\"><div style=\"width: 150px; flex-shrink: 0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #5C554D\">Found missing</div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.4\">Friday 10 March, 08:30</div></div></div>", "poster": "<div style=\"width: 794px; height: 1123px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 44px; background: #F3EEE4; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; overflow: hidden\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #A4161A\">CASE NO. 122 · LEVEL 2 · THEFT</div>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 46px; line-height: 1.02; color: #1E1B18; font-weight: 400\">THE CUP FINAL<br>TICKETS</h1>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start\">\n<div style=\"transform: rotate(4deg); border: 4px solid #A4161A; color: #A4161A; padding: 10px 16px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 8px; background: #FFFDF8\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">CLUE</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 44px; line-height: 1\">1</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.08em\">OF 6</div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 6px\"><div class=\"qr\" data-url=\"{{ANSWER_URL}}\" style=\"width: 96px; height: 96px\"></div><div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #1E1B18\">SCAN TO ANSWER</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #1E1B18; color: #F3EEE4; padding: 14px 18px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5\">At <b>Northbridge Rovers FC</b>, forty tickets for the county cup final – block K, seats 101 to 140 – were stolen from the ticket-office safe overnight. Some are already for sale online. Find all 6 clues, compare the statements and the evidence, and work out who did it.</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: stretch; height: 290px\">\n<div style=\"width: 210px; flex-shrink: 0; transform: rotate(-2deg); background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #1E1B18; padding: 12px 12px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: -9px; left: 97px; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: #A4161A\"></div>\n<div style=\"height: 190px; background: #DDD5C7; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden\">{{FACE:the-cup-final-tickets/priya-sood}}</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E1B18; line-height: 1.2\">Priya Sood</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #5C554D; margin-top: -6px\">Club secretary</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0; background: #FFFDF8; border: 3px solid #1E1B18; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Special Elite', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1E1B18